flowchart TB
    U[Authenticated user] --> FE[React dashboard\nDashboardLayout navigation]
    FE --> TRPC[tRPC protected procedures]
    TRPC --> AUTH[Manus OAuth session\nprotectedProcedure]

    subgraph SERVICES[Server-side services]
      APP[Application service\nCRUD + status validation]
      RESUME[Resume service\nupload + associations]
      MATCH[AI skill match service\ndeterministic baseline + structured JSON]
      ANALYTICS[Analytics service\nuser-scoped aggregates]
    end

    TRPC --> APP
    TRPC --> RESUME
    TRPC --> MATCH
    TRPC --> ANALYTICS
    APP --> DB[(MySQL/TiDB database)]
    RESUME --> DB
    RESUME --> S3[(S3 resume storage)]
    MATCH --> DB
    MATCH <--> LLM[Built-in server-side LLM]
    ANALYTICS --> DB
